# Elevation (nominally feet) and RGB components normalized to [0, 1].
# Also accepts three decimal bytes (0 0 255) or one hex colour (0000FF).
# Use a decimal point or exponent to select normalized floats; otherwise RGB is bytes.
# Any whitespace separates fields; # starts a standalone or trailing comment.
# One continuous map spanning -32767 to +32767, with no special sea-level value.
# The narrow blue-to-green transition is a choice of this palette, not the format.
-32767  0.02    0.08    0.25
    -1  0.15    0.55    0.65
     0  0.18    0.48    0.18
 13106  0.72    0.68    0.42
 26213  0.45    0.38    0.30
 32767  0.95    0.95    0.98
